# Security hardening
!.env.example
*-key.pem
KubeSecrets/
kubeSecrets/

# PWA — public/sw.js is now a hand-written static file (next-pwa doesn't run under Turbopack,
# see next.config.ts), committed like pos-ui's; only the old auto-generated workbox artifacts
# stay ignored so a stray local `next-pwa`-enabled build never re-adds them.
public/workbox-*.js
public/workbox-*.js.map
public/swe-worker-*.js
public/fallback-*.js
